{"chunk_id": "398a4477e477", "text": "Ravana attempts once more to seduce Sita with boasts, flattery, and promises of wealth, power, and queenship over his harem. He belittles Rama as an exiled ascetic and insists that Sita accept the pleasures of Lanka. Sita, grief\u2011stricken yet resolute, places a straw between herself and Ravana\u2014a symbolic gesture of contempt\u2014and rebukes him. She declares her absolute fidelity to Rama and condemns Ravana\u2019s unrighteous desire for another man\u2019s wife. Sita warns that a king who cannot master himself brings ruin upon his kingdom and predicts the destruction of Lanka. She urges Ravana to return her and seek Rama\u2019s friendship, but prophesies that if he refuses, Rama\u2019s arrows will descend on Lanka like flaming serpents and annihilate the rakshasas.\nSita firmly rejects Ravana\u2019s temptations, rebukes his immorality, prophesies Lanka\u2019s destruction, and declares unwavering devotion to Rama.\nThemes: chastity and fidelity, defiance of tyranny, dharma and morality, prophecy of downfall, devotion to Rama", "vector": [-4.7915646064211614e-06, -0.01927262172102928, -0.00429111672565341, 0.005402998998761177, -0.007473751436918974, 0.0072289337404072285, -0.04221751540899277, -0.0009495200938545167, -0.021421581506729126, -0.021489586681127548, 0.017205270007252693, 0.015097114257514477, 0.021013550460338593, 0.020877540111541748, 0.003655269742012024, -0.0008730144472792745, 0.0462162122130394, -0.017205270007252693, 0.03310484439134598, -0.018769385293126106, -0.006552283652126789, -0.018238946795463562, -0.0021897617261856794, -0.008215006440877914, -0.039769336581230164, -0.004773952532559633, 0.02104075253009796, -0.032207176089286804, 0.01452587265521288, -0.0032676411792635918, -0.018891794607043266, -0.010268758051097393, -0.006861706264317036, -0.008561831898987293, -0.04648823291063309, -0.005596813280135393, -0.016362007707357407, -0.021503187716007233, 0.011003212071955204, -0.004821555688977